のがまだ謎ですが…\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1628954122379900|https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1628954122379900\u003e","ts":"1628958987.395000","attachments":[{"fallback":"[August 14th, 2021 8:15 AM] biosugar0: ちなみにvim-lsp使ってる人だれか再現しますかね？\n400行目くらいからおかしくなるんですが。。\nいまのところ条件はvim-lspによってテキストプロパティが設定されていることですね。\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/biosugar0/55b4d3e7a1d3f8436821c516c339732a\u003e","id":1,"author_id":"US90LD360","author_name":"biosugar0","author_subname":"biosugar0","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/US90LD360","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-01-24/922945432742_a87307dba854c940256e_48.png","text":"ちなみにvim-lsp使ってる人だれか再現しますかね？\n400行目くらいからおかしくなるんですが。。\nいまのところ条件はvim-lspによってテキストプロパティが設定されていることですね。\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/biosugar0/55b4d3e7a1d3f8436821c516c339732a\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #plugins","ts":1628954122.379900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1628954122379900","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1628954122379900"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I7cFG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a46842e2-f7f4-418f-824f-776c3d3dc459","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"最小手順ですかね?","ts":"1628958693.391300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/+G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d71a50ad-8402-4dc0-a9ac-e53400757234","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"お","ts":"1628958665.391000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n4mS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"120c5c22-389c-4ef0-8291-0ec7f61ffaf5","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"あ、vim-lsp使ってないvimrcと.vimディレクトリ削除した環境でも\n```:echom line2byte('.')\n:call prop_type_add('vim-test',{'bufnr':1})\n:call prop_add(2,1,{'bufnr': 1, 'id': 2, 'type': 'vim-test'})\n:echom line2byte('.')```\nすると値変わりましたね。lsp関係ないか？","ts":"1628957780.390000","edited":{"user":"US90LD360","ts":"1628958288.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tfy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b41df7d7-f5c0-4410-acfa-37a49a6ee47f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ソース読んだほうが良さそうな気もする (読めばわかるとは言っていない)","ts":"1628955921.388600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ziPNd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7897e0a2-70db-4b7e-9809-9b434b3fe169","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーん、最小のパターンだと特におかしくはならない…","ts":"1628955906.388100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wpm7g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4ff9666-09d6-43ac-bd2f-a74ffabde5d0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"バッファローカルタイプだと起きるのかな。試してみるか","ts":"1628955717.387700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v=z0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69e499d9-ba49-423c-805c-bab0f3a26099","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"お、中身返ってきましたね\n```{'end_incl': 0, 'bufnr': 1, 'start_incl': 0, 'priority': 0, 'combine': 1}```","ts":"1628955588.387400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h1/x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a746cbbd-7306-4e12-ac00-e4fe7179be0a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"むむ。 `:echo prop_type_get('vim-lsp-folding-linenr', {'bufnr': 1})` かな?","ts":"1628955520.387000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VVCSI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f37c71cd-1af1-4a22-9237-0a67323a57a2","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"`{}` が返ってきました","ts":"1628955454.386400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JDC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d49f71ca-d23d-4877-a94a-f14cdac5628f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`:echo prop_type_get('vim-lsp-folding-linenr')` するとどうなるでしょう?","ts":"1628955357.386000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FVObo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e257c583-be95-4646-8ca8-8b7a71b82ffb","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"vim-lspを有効化している状態で、\nvim-lsp側のprop_addをコメントアウトして\n手で後から\n```:call prop_add(2,1,{'bufnr': 1, 'id': 2, 'type': 'vim-lsp-folding-linenr'})```\nみたいにテキストプロパティ追加すると追加したぶんline2byteの結果がズレていきますね","ts":"1628955286.385400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rurZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07b21928-fda0-4ded-b818-fbba8209dd54","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"適当にline2byteのソースを開いてみたけど想像していたよりコードの量が多かった…","ts":"1628954484.383800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"muzu","count":1,"users":["US90LD360"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R0o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5ea4fe2-45c5-4783-bf20-8f22b65d4c3d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"素の Vim と言うか vimrc とかを指定していない Vim で適当にバッファにテキスト入れて更に適当に textprop を設定してみた感じです","ts":"1628954409.383100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RBe+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49f889d0-3405-4df4-ba75-e7798ee03827","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"適当に素の Vim に textprop を設定してみたけど、特におかしくならないな。なんかもっと条件があるのかも","ts":"1628954321.381700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["US90LD360"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/+FG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"418cdc1d-6de9-4478-9f36-feff7f7d5bd4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":contribute-chance:","ts":"1628954307.381300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_